# Quick Start Guide

## For Users With Data Access

1. Clone this repository:
```bash
   git clone https://github.com/asrommel/prenatal_inflammation_anxiety.git
   cd prenatal_inflammation_anxiety
```

2. Place your data files in `data/raw/`:
   - Mental health hx 2024-6-6_all variables.csv
   - GenC20-CarlyGADAndImmuneAct_DATA_2024-07-15_1505_FM.csv
   - Logbook 4.20.21_ML2 1.20.23 Frederieke_[55].xlsx - Sheet 1 - ...

3. Run the analysis in RStudio:
```r
   source("data_cleaning_and_analysis.R")
```

Results will appear in the `output/` folder.

**Time needed:** ~10 minutes  
**For help:** See README.md or DATA_DICTIONARY.md
